credential leak, redirects refused, limit bounded. Its protocol findings are real but rest on uncited external claims. It did not use the research/ references and did not cite them. It has no explicit coverage ledger and only a limited statement of what was unreviewed. It states host enforcement of the 8 KiB limit as fact, and it does not assess the tools/call allowlist. It gives no deployment verdict, but \"Security: no vulnerability\" with no deployment-authorization disclaimer is mildly assuring."},"ttft_ms":1124,"type":"result","duration_ms":39425,"uuid":"289734b0-8992-4119-af77-c199f1c9c91e","ttft_stream_ms":784,"time_to_request_ms":70,"first_content_frame_ms":784,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":5961,"cacheReadInputTokens":32477,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11281,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1079977,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1219,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
